      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Dedication of a Synagogue” was written and delivered by Rabbi Jacob Bosniak on 23 October 1926, at the dedication of the Ocean Parkway Jewish Center. The prayer was first published in Rabbi Bosniak’s לקוטי תפלות <tei:hi rend="italic">Liḳutei Tefilot: Pulpit and Public Prayers</tei:hi> (1927), pp. 106-107.</tei:p>
